    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ramsay hunt sounds scary... is that like a stroke or something? i really don't want to go to the er if i can help it. it's super expensive and the wait times are insane. if it's just a migraine aura like i thought, can i just take some extra sumatriptan and sleep it off? how much can i safely take if it's really bad?",
